## Phase: Gaps (converge round 2)

- [ ] 14. Prove stream mode flushes after every 64 KiB chunk (backend, test)
  Covers: AC-3
  - [ ] 14.1 **Verify**: a test in `tests/Feature/ServeExportTest.php` named for AC-3 sends a `mode=stream` response for a file of N full chunks plus a remainder through an output buffer whose callback records each call's write length and `PHP_OUTPUT_HANDLER_FLUSH` phase; it asserts one flush per chunk (N + 1 flushes) and that every flushed write except the last is exactly `ExportStreamer::CHUNK_BYTES`. It fails if the `ob_flush()`/`flush()` calls in `app/Support/ExportStreamer.php` are removed, and `ddev artisan test --compact tests/Feature/ServeExportTest.php` passes.
